                <title><![CDATA[【Unreleased/Unofficial (lossy)】MP3 - Lana Del Rey - Born To Die: B-Sides (Offical List) [MP3, M4A 320kpbs, WAV 16bit | 44.1kHz]]]></title>
                <link><![CDATA[https://sharemania.us/threads/lana-del-rey-born-to-die-b-sides-offical-list-mp3-m4a-320kpbs-wav-16bit-44-1khz.294512/]]></link>
                <description><![CDATA[<article>
				<blockquote class="messageText SelectQuoteContainer ugc baseHtml">
					
					<div style="text-align: center"><img src="https://i.imgur.com/FZoLnuF.jpeg" class="bbCodeImage LbImage" alt="[​IMG]" data-url="https://i.imgur.com/FZoLnuF.jpeg" style=""><br>
<b><span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-size: 26px">Born To Die: B-Sides</span></span><br>
<span style="font-size: 22px">Lana Del Rey</span></b><br>
<br>
<b><span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-size: 22px">Description</span></span></b><br>
<span style="font-size: 12px"><b>In early 2012, after <i>Born To Die</i> and before <i>Paradise. </i>Lana made a list of <span style="font-family: 'Arial'">29 songs</span> she was considering for a <i>B-Side/Deluxe </i>of <i>Born To Die </i>(4 of the tracks unknown). For unknown reasons, Lana scrapped the project and instead reworked it into <i>Paradise</i>. The only song that was released is <i>Lucky Ones</i>, the other ones faced a different fate. On February 17th 2026, a leaker/insider shared the last 2 versions of tracks we were missing ("<i>TV in Black &amp; White (Mix 13)</i>" &amp; "<i>Lucky Ones (Demo 2)</i>"). Alongside that, they shared the list of considerations for the <i>B-Side</i>. It's not a "Tracklist" nor in a specific order, but just considerations for the project.</b></span><br>
<b><br>
<span style="font-size: 15px">+ The photo i used was (most likely,) originally supposed to be the cover for <i>Paradise </i><a href="https://x.com/LanaDelLeaks/status/1887019653139997026" target="_blank" class="externalLink" rel="nofollow">(Info from here)</a>.</span><br>
<br>
<span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-size: 22px">Information</span></span><br>
<span style="font-size: 15px">Recorded: 2009/2010 - 2012<br>
Formats: mp3/m4a(aac)/wav<br>
Total Tracks: 25 (4 unkown)<br>
Size: 302.3 MB</span><br>
<br>
<span style="text-decoration: underline"><span style="font-size: 22px">Tracklist</span></span></b><br>
<span style="font-size: 18px"><b>1. </b>Hollywood's Dead<br>
<b>2. </b>Damn You<br>
<b>3. </b>Velvet Crowbar<br>
<b>4. </b>On Our Way<br>
